// FIXTURE — must be caught by PINE063
//
// TradingView: Error at 204:15 "range" cannot be used as a variable or
// function name.
//
// Pine reserves a set of words for FUTURE use. They do nothing today, nothing
// in the editor marks them, and every one of them is a name somebody would
// reach for without thinking - range, text, in, is, do, return.
//
// `float range = high - low` reads as completely ordinary code. It shipped
// twice from one file here, and a third copy was sitting in the shared library,
// which therefore could not compile either and nobody had noticed because
// nothing had ever tried to.
//@version=6
indicator("Reserved Word", overlay = true)

// bad — reserved
float range = high - low

// good — an ordinary name
float span = high - low

plot(span, title = "Span")
